  "description": "\"As a man, I'll tell you honestly whether you make my heart flutter or die down.\"\n\nChildhood friends Lee Jin-sol and Gye Seon-woo.   \nEntering the same university, they maintain a platonic male-female friend dynamic. Jin-sol dreams of a college life breaking away from her goody-two-shoes image and tries to start a new romance, but fails repeatedly.   \nSeeking to understand why she isn't popular with men, she asks Seon-woo for advice, and to figure out the reason, the two end up sleeping together...\n\n\"Why don't you go lie down on the bed first?\"\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/505109155)",
